     "body": "<p><span class=\"error\">&#91;Followup from Sourceforge Tracker&#93;</span><br/>\nFollowup Submitter: bbranan<br/>\nLogged In: YES <br/>\nuser_id=1987639<br/>\nOriginator: NO</p>\n\n<p>As part of the messaging task (142344) the fedora-base.fcfg was updated to allow FOXML 1.0 format as an ingest/export option and tests were added to check this in TestAPIM. The API-M documentation was also updated to include the FOXML 1.0 format option. So part one is complete. Part two still needs to be done, meaning updates to the admin client and command-line utilities and their respective documentation.</p>",
