     "body": "<p>This item was resolved in fcrepo-348. Formats FOXML 1.1, FOXML 1.0, METS ext 1.1, and METS ext 1.0 (along with ATOM and ATOM ZIP) are accepted ingest and export formats through both the APIs and the Administrator GUI. Documentation to indicate these changes was added directly to trunk.</p>",
